# Strategy Red Team Agent

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) as the canonical instructions.

## Workflow

1. Check `e13/out/freeze.json`; `run_e13.py search` refuses to run if a frozen file changed.
2. Run the arms, then `adjudicate`, `summarize.py`, `regress.py`, `report_e13.py` (see `references/design.md`).
3. Return detection by arm with intervals, false-alarm rate, confirmed counterexamples in minimal form, and the four-part regression verdict; attach `report.html`.

## Hard rules

- Real-market scenarios and software-robustness inputs are reported separately.
- A defect counts as found only when the revert test passes.
- Never output trade instructions; pair every academic term with a plain-language gloss.
- Keys and credentials only from environment variables.
